  "description": "# Device Properties and Events\n\nThis package contains an extension module for the Jabra .NET SDK. It facilitates working with properties and events on Jabra devices.\n\n## Documentation and Support\n \nFor documentation, release notes, support, and other information please visit the Jabra Developer Zone on https://developer.jabra.com.",
