  "releaseNotes": "## [2.4.4.0] - 2025-06-19\n\n### Added\n\n- Allow updates to array and object property values. Since complex property must always be written in their entirety,\n  it may be convenient to read the existing value and only update parts of it and write the whole property back.\n- Support for the `equals`, `notEquals` and `assignIf` operators in property definitions.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Some devices may send single malformed events that cause deserialization to fail. That would break the event stream.\n  Malformed events are now skipped and the stream continues.",
